{"strongs": "H6212", "word": "עֵ֫שֶׂב", "translit": "e.sev", "root": "עשב", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "herb, herbage", "definition": "עֵ֫שֶׂב noun masculine Gen 1:11 herb, herbage ; — ׳ ע absolute Deut 11:15 +; construct Gen 2:5 +; suffix עֶשְׂבָּם Isa 42:15 plural construct עִשְּׂבוֺת (dagesh forte dirimens) Prov 27:25 — herb, herbage , in oldest use often general (therefore including grass [ דֶּשֶׁא ]): הַשָּׂדֶה ׳ ע Exod 9:22 ( E ), Gen 2:5 (+ שִׂיחַ ) Exod 9:25 (+ עֵץ ), Exod 10:15 (+ id ; all J ) Amos 7:2 , so הָאָרֶץ ׳ ע Exod 10:12 ( E ), + פְּרִי הָעֵץ v Exod 10:15 ( J ), whence Ps 105:35 apparently generally also in הארץ ׳ ע Job 5:25 ; Ps 72:16 , ׳ ע alone Ps 92:8 כָּלהַֿשָּׂדֶה ׳ ע Jer 12:14 , ׳ ע alone Deut 32:2 (|| דֶּשֶׁא ), Isa 42:15 ; Ps 102:5 ; Ps 102:12 , and Deut 29:22 ; Mic 5:6 ; Prov 19:12 hence ׳ ע as food for cattle Deut 11:15 ; Ps 106:20 compare Jer 14:6 ; Zech 10:1 עִשְּׂבוֺת הָרִים Prov 27:25 (|| דֶּשֶׁא , חָצִיר ); but as human food (hence excluding דֶּשֶׁא ) הַשָּׂדֶה ׳ ע Gen 3:18 ( J ); especially P Gen 1:29 (+ עֶץ ), ׳ יֶרֶק ע v Gen 1:30 ; Gen 9:3 , hence ׳ ע Ps 104:14 (|| חָצִיר for cattle); ׳ ע distinguished from דֶּשֶׁא , עֵץ also Gen 1:11 ; Gen 1:12 , שָׂדֶה ׳ ע + דֶּשֶׁא , חָצִיר 2Kgs 19:26 + Isa 37:27 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6427')\">BDB6427</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6212')\">H6212</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6426')\">BDB6426</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6428')\">BDB6428</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֵ֫שֶׂב</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 1:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,11)\">Gen 1:11</ref></sup> <highlightword>herb, herbage</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Deut 11:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,15)\">Deut 11:15</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Gen 2:5\"